# About

I'm Lautaro Acosta Quintana, a programmer from Argentina with professional experience in web development. My experience is primarily in designing, implementing and deploying backend systems and, to a lesser degree, building user interfaces. You can email me at [*email protected*]{.email-address data-address="moc.atsocaoratual@em"}.

I like to solve problems and figure out the best way to do things. I focus on building software that is reliable, efficient and understandable. My main interests right now range from system design and distributed computing to language design. 

Currently, I'm also student pursuing an Information Systems Engineering degree at [UTN](https://www.frre.utn.edu.ar/).

While I do spend a [*lot of time* reading](/reading.html), I try to [write about things I find interesting](/writing.html).

